1
00:00:00,294 --> 00:00:03,294
Monkey See, Monkey Kill.

2
00:00:06,533 --> 00:00:09,573
You know, it's still possible
for you to be good in a bad movie.

3
00:00:09,737 --> 00:00:11,077
(Bernadette:)Okay.

4
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,780
"Sometimes I feel like I can control

5
00:00:14,942 --> 00:00:16,782
(Penny:)the killer gorilla instinct
inside of me,

6
00:00:16,944 --> 00:00:18,754
(Penny:)but then I see these bananas

7
00:00:18,913 --> 00:00:21,823
(Penny:)and I just want to eat them
and then kill people."

8
00:00:25,986 --> 00:00:27,436
(Penny:)What am I gonna do?

9
00:00:27,588 --> 00:00:30,938
(Leonard:)Well, for starters,
I wouldn't eat the bananas.

10
00:00:31,659 --> 00:00:33,659
Come on! This is serious.

11
00:00:33,794 --> 00:00:35,934
(Leonard:)Does it at least pay well?

12
00:00:36,096 --> 00:00:38,136
(Penny:)Less than I was making
at The Cheesecake Factory.

13
00:00:38,632 --> 00:00:39,632
(Leonard:)What does your agent think?

14
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,140
(Penny:)She's thinking of taking a job
at The Cheesecake Factory.

15
00:00:44,672 --> 00:00:46,342
(Leonard:)You know what,
why don't you just do it?

16
00:00:46,507 --> 00:00:48,847
(Leonard:)You'll go have fun for a few weeks,
make some money,

17
00:00:49,009 --> 00:00:50,959
(Leonard:)and who knows what it might lead to?

18
00:00:51,111 --> 00:00:52,351
(Penny:)Okay, look, here, page 58.

19
00:00:52,513 --> 00:00:55,083
(Penny:)I oil-wrestle an orangutan
in a bikini.

20
00:00:56,517 --> 00:01:00,027
(Leonard:)Just to clarify, which one
of you is wearing the bikini?

